# Agent Guidelines

- Package management: `uv`
- Hooks: `prek install -t pre-commit -t commit-msg -t pre-push` then `prek run --all-files`
- Skill sync: `uv run library-skills --tool-skill install --claude --yes --all`
- Linting: `uv run ruff check .` and `uv run ruff format .`
- Type checking: `uv run pyright`
- Tests: `uv run pytest`
- Migrations: `uv run alembic upgrade head`
- Architecture: Configurable scopes with dependency injection, async SQLAlchemy, queue handoff{% if enable_telemetry %}, and OpenTelemetry{% endif %}
- `container.py` defines the `ServiceContainer` shape (no runtime service imports); `bootstrap.py` builds one. Don't import `bootstrap` from request-time code — import `container` instead.
- `azure-storage-queue` is optional (`uv sync --extra azure`); don't hard-import it at module scope in `database/queues.py`.
